{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25219","headline":"姑熟杂咏 天门山 · 李赤","name":"姑熟杂咏 天门山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迥出江水上，双峰自相对。\n岸映松色寒，石分浪花碎。\n参差远天际，缥缈晴霞外。\n落日舟去遥，回首沈青霭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李赤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}